<classes><group name="worldspawn" colour="0.5 0.5 0.5">World brush and patch geometry. Review changes in Studio before applying.</group><point name="info_player_start" colour="0.2 0.8 0.4" box="-16 -16 -24 16 16 32">Neutral spawn. Team and hunter policy stays in the native Prime project for geometry-only editing.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><angle key="angle" name="Facing" value="0" /></point><point name="info_player_deathmatch" colour="0.2 0.8 0.4" box="-16 -16 -24 16 16 32">Neutral spawn. Team and hunter policy stays in the native Prime project for geometry-only editing.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><angle key="angle" name="Facing" value="0" /></point><point name="weapon_railgun" colour="0.2 0.8 0.4" box="-16 -16 -24 16 16 32">Canonical Quake-to-Prime pickup mapping. Geometry-only edits retain native pickup policy.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><integer key="prime_spawn_interval" name="Respawn simulation frames" value="300" /><string key="prime_has_base" name="Has base" value="true" /></point><point name="weapon_rocketlauncher" colour="0.2 0.8 0.4" box="-16 -16 -24 16 16 32">Canonical Quake-to-Prime pickup mapping. Geometry-only edits retain native pickup policy.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><integer key="prime_spawn_interval" name="Respawn simulation frames" value="300" /><string key="prime_has_base" name="Has base" value="true" /></point><point name="weapon_lightning" colour="0.2 0.8 0.4" box="-16 -16 -24 16 16 32">Canonical Quake-to-Prime pickup mapping. Geometry-only edits retain native pickup policy.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><integer key="prime_spa